      <input type="text" class="form-control" name="summary" value="&lt;p&gt; Created an AR ATM training app for 22+ rural seniors (ages 55–80), increasing post-training ATM confidence to 80% (median), with 68% likely to use ATMs, a transaction accuracy of 82%, and p-value &lt; 0.01 validating significant reduction in transaction time and security fears. &lt;/p&gt;" required>
